rporated entity",384.32,140.91,96.55,9,0,0],["(describe)",481.56,141.13,40.01,9,3,0],[":",521.57,141.13,2.5,9,0,0],["(4)",340.11,165.82,11,9,0,0],["an public entity",384.32,165.82,60.03,9,0,0],["(describe)",446.56,165.5,40.01,9,3,0],[":",486.57,165.5,2.5,9,0,0],["(5)",340.12,191.56,11,9,0,0],["other",384.32,191.56,20.51,9,0,0],["(specify)",406.86,191.43,34,9,3,0],[":",440.86,191.43,2.5,9,0,0],["Information about additional cross-defendants who are not natural persons is contained in",89.26,221.08,356.68,9,0,0],["Cross-Complaint—Attachment 4.",89.26,231.88,131.54,9,0,0],["5.",36,253.94,7.51,9,0,0],["The true names and capacities of cross-defendants sued as Does are unknown to cross-complainant.",52.4,253.94,404.18,9,0,0],["6.",36,270.82,7.51,9,0,0],["Cross-complainant is required to comply with a claims statute,",77.21,270.82,246.57,9,0,0],["and",326.3,270.82,16,9,1,0],["a.",50.33,285.13,7.51,9,0,0],["has complied with applicable claims statutes,",92.28,285.13,179.06,9,0,0],["or",273.86,285.13,9,9,1,0],["b.",50.33,298.15,7.51,9,0,0],["is excused from complying because",92.28,298.15,142.55,9,0,0],["(specify)",240.1,298.18,34,9,3,0],[":",274.01,298.18,2.5,9,0,0],["7.",36.54,444.55,7.51,9,0,0],["Cause of Action—Indemnification",179.85,444.05,144.02,9,1,0],["(NUMBER)",103.36,456.6,29.99,6,0,0],["a.",50.33,468.29,7.51,9,0,0],["Cross-defendants were the agents, employees, co-venturers, partners, or in some manner agents or principals, or both, for",65.48,469.7,488.2,9,0,0],["each other and were acting within the course and scope of their agency or employment.",65.48,480.5,348.67,9,0,0],["b.",50.98,496.8,7.51,9,0,0],["The principal action alleges, among other things, conduct entitling plaintiff to compensatory damages against me. I contend that",65.48,498.21,506.75,9,0,0],["I am not liable for events and occurrences described in plaintiff's complaint.",65.48,509.01,298.85,9,0,0],["c.",51.04,526.29,7,9,0,0],["If I am found in some manner responsible to plaintiff or to anyone else as a result of the incidents and occurrences described in",65.48,527.7,505.24,9,0,0],["plaintiff's complaint, my liability would be based solely upon a derivative form of liability not resulting from my conduct, but only",65.48,538.5,501.41,9,0,0],["from an obligation imposed upon me by law; therefore, I would be entitled to complete indemnity from each cross-defendant.",65.48,549.3,494.23,9,0,0],["8.",36,567,7.51,9,0,0],["Cause of Action—Apportionment of Fault",206.47,566.51,177,9,1,0],["(NUMBER)",118.75,579.48,29.99,6,0,0],["a.",51.04,590.88,7.51,9,0,0],["Each cross-defendant was responsible, in whole or in part, for the injuries, if any, suffered by plaintiff.",65.48,592.29,401.68,9,0,0],["b.",50.98,607.74,7.51,9,0,0],["If I am judged liable to plaintiff, each cross-defendant should be required: (1) to pay a share of plaintiffs judgment which is in",65.48,609.16,492.24,9,0,0],["proportion to the comparative negligence of that cross-defendant in causing plaintiff's damages; and (2) to reimburse me for",65.48,619.96,491.44,9,0,0],["any payments I make to plaintiff in excess of my proportional share of all cross-defendants' negligence.",65.48,630.76,409.4,9,0,0],["Page 2 of 3",544.32,732.66,31.68,6,1,0]],"fields":[[40.4,59.63,394.96,70.47,9,0],[400.01,58.87,572.8,73.26,9,0],[222.57,102.27,321.55,113.23,9,0],[110.29,153.71,316.11,164.66,9,0],[110.29,177.86,316.11,189.52,9,0],[110.6,204.4,316.42,215.65,9,0],[497.66,102.47,575.34,113.42,9,0],[384.04,152.99,568.05,163.94,9,0],[384.04,176.88,567.73,188.8,9,0],[384.36,203.36,567.07,214.19,9,0],[92.49,310.03,575.13,442,9,0],[70.85,445.47,179.85,456.42,9,0],[70.85,567.93,206.47,578.89,9,0]],"boxes":[[70.5,103.45,79.5,112.45],[89.35,118.84,98.35,127.84],[89.35,131.02,98.35,140.02],[88.78,143.52,97.78,152.52],[88.78,168.43,97.78,177.43],[88.78,194.17,97.78,203.17],[344.26,103.45,353.26,112.45],[363.11,118.12,372.11,127.12],[363.11,130.3,372.11,139.3],[362.54,142.8,371.54,151.8],[362.54,167.71,371.54,176.71],[362.54,193.